## Generation Rules

- Start each section with the EXACT marker `## SECTION_{{ "N" }}:` where N is the section number (e.g. `## SECTION_{{ batch_sections[0].number if batch_sections else "1" }}:`). Section content follows immediately after the marker.
- Write from the perspective of a senior SAP Functional Consultant. No raw code, technical configurations, or developer-level detail.
- Every section must use at least one of: structured prose, a table, or a bulleted list — no unstructured walls of text
- Prose paragraphs must not exceed 4–6 sentences
- Where the input is silent and no clarification was given, record an assumption — never invent a requirement
